      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766606015526,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "可能：\n① 独立显存(集显)\n② 共用系统内存(独显)",
      "fontSize": 3.0782851256918278,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "可能：\n① 独立显存(集显)\n② 共用系统内存(独显)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "-1UzuD4kVzzArG8sETM9r",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -272.6344758150535,
      "y": 667.2694339725147,
      "width": 47.73755086445703,
      "height": 15.972353447955356,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 0.5,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bJ4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1021109655,
      "version": 128,
      "versionNonce": 1958445847,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766606015526,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "定时(按照显示刷新率)，从显存中\n“扫描”出图像数据，转换成视频信\n号（HDMI、DisplayPort、LVDS\n等）输出给显示器",
      "fontSize": 3.1944706895910713,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "定时(按照显示刷新率)，从显存中“扫描”出图像数据，转换成视频信号（HDMI、DisplayPort、LVDS等）输出给显示器",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Ugo0WLvfXW4tj0c1HRNPN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1082.2331874303518,
      "y": 1279.4940819849808,
      "width": 1594.022216796875,
      "height": 95.68664014436978,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 0.5,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "3JilugtQTs-olBtfIHROH"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bJ5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 628759223,
      "version": 238,
      "versionNonce": 1923680311,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766606015526,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "等到自己把soc做出来你就能完全理解硬件层面的状态(到那个时候soc的模型就能做出来)\n等到把编译器做出来你就能完全理解软件层面的状态(到那个时候写代码时的模型就能做出来了)",
      "fontSize": 38.27465605774791,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "等到自己把soc做出来你就能完全理解硬件层面的状态(到那个时候soc的模型就能做出来)\n等到把编译器做出来你就能完全理解软件层面的状态(到那个时候写代码时的模型就能做出来了)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "txHgYWkxdplg7gmpbHzMS",
      "type": "image",
      "x": -1405.5665484874326,
      "y": 1165.6707216625211,
      "width": 323.3333611428601,
      "height": 323.3333611428601,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "transparent",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
