      "updated": 1766606015527,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "关于启动引脚的猜测:",
      "fontSize": 23.15294990937318,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "关于启动引脚的猜测:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "SVZ0zJHluwA1wPqQwR2Y7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 402.22705471664494,
      "y": 733.935660195446,
      "width": 384,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 0.5,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "sa5A2h_nsZ1AomrQgdpIl"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bJI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 266371415,
      "version": 235,
      "versionNonce": 102072023,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766606015527,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "可能是上电后，有一个寄存器专门用来储存启动引脚的\n状态，然后bootROM开始执行的时候会检测这个引脚寄\n存器的状态，然后再根据这个跳转到不同的位置",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "可能是上电后，有一个寄存器专门用来储存启动引脚的状态，然后bootROM开始执行的时候会检测这个引脚寄存器的状态，然后再根据这个跳转到不同的位置",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
