      "text": "两份数据一样",
      "fontSize": 9.044775454841934,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "两份数据一样",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "EsdOjiQ6AjmG8pUDaxBcz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1489.128475326431,
      "y": -157.55245945250908,
      "width": 151.2606320861667,
      "height": 8.525297825095727,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 0.5,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bK9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 273998071,
      "version": 214,
      "versionNonce": 1939500663,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766606015529,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "写外设寄存器速度很慢（AHB/APB 外设速度低）",
      "fontSize": 6.820238260076581,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "写外设寄存器速度很慢（AHB/APB 外设速度低）",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "UETnhlMS38jjn6gz372zL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1489.1284750168377,
      "y": -149.0271621521265,
      "width": 188.9692562998027,
      "height": 8.525297825095727,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 0.5,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bKA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1931192855,
      "version": 257,
      "versionNonce": 1095993239,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766606015529,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果不用写缓冲，CPU 必须等待寄存器真正写成功 → 很慢",
      "fontSize": 6.820238260076581,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果不用写缓冲，CPU 必须等待寄存器真正写成功 → 很慢",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xsT5VP0nt8LhM3NafmMV2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1489.128475665476,
      "y": -140.50186476429099,
      "width": 195.84027194108268,
      "height": 17.050595650191454,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 0.5,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bKB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 543969079,
      "version": 250,
      "versionNonce": 1724677303,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766606015529,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "开启 Bufferable 后，CPU 把写操作先放到 write buffer 就继\n续执行后面的指令",
      "fontSize": 6.820238260076581,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "开启 Bufferable 后，CPU 把写操作先放到 write buffer 就继续执行后面的指令",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
