      "updated": 1766606015530,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Shareable",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "1WNLwzUKV5EPuW0e5FUaq",
      "originalText": "Shareable",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "nVVeJLHg9r74mUYB3ZOGg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1853.3349408657898,
      "y": 145.70025726980975,
      "width": 346.8785882521483,
      "height": 71.55560878482562,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 0.5,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bKP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 158896887,
      "version": 72,
      "versionNonce": 691216503,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766606015530,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果内存是 Shareable = 0，CPU 会认为“只有我访问这块内存”，就\n会做 aggressive 优化，比如：\n数据留在 Cache 不写回内存\n读数据时直接从 Cache 拿，不去内存读\n可以合并写、乱序访问等",
      "fontSize": 11.448897405572101,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果内存是 Shareable = 0，CPU 会认为“只有我访问这块内存”，就会做 aggressive 优化，比如：\n数据留在 Cache 不写回内存\n读数据时直接从 Cache 拿，不去内存读\n可以合并写、乱序访问等",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "lhCFS5ZYoiLXYA9-T1OFQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1853.3349415447578,
      "y": 219.86919988607997,
      "width": 359.6639404296875,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 0.5,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bKQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 821632023,
      "version": 39,
      "versionNonce": 1694890391,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766606015530,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "这样 DMA、外设、其他 CPU 就看不到最新数据。",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "这样 DMA、外设、其他 CPU 就看不到最新数据。",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
