      "text": "Bootloader → OpenSBI → 操作系统内核（Linux、RTOS等）",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Bootloader → OpenSBI → 操作系统内核（Linux、RTOS等）",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "Ri7DV4H3imYDjOYWZqPAT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5054.827291578045,
      "y": -781.41565603896,
      "width": 685.3125,
      "height": 336,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bM2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 633336635,
      "version": 95,
      "versionNonce": 1785535483,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1766785322151,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "// 简化启动流程\n1. 硬件上电 → 2. Bootloader（U-Boot等） → 3. 加载OpenSBI到内存\n    ↓\n4. OpenSBI初始化：\n   - 设置异常向量表\n   - 初始化串口、中断控制器\n   - 设置定时器\n   - 检测可用Hart\n    ↓  \n5. 启动主Hart（hart0）：\n   - 进入S-mode\n   - 跳转到操作系统入口（如Linux内核）\n    ↓\n6. 操作系统通过ecall指令调用SBI服务",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "// 简化启动流程\n1. 硬件上电 → 2. Bootloader（U-Boot等） → 3. 加载OpenSBI到内存\n    ↓\n4. OpenSBI初始化：\n   - 设置异常向量表\n   - 初始化串口、中断控制器\n   - 设置定时器\n   - 检测可用Hart\n    ↓  \n5. 启动主Hart（hart0）：\n   - 进入S-mode\n   - 跳转到操作系统入口（如Linux内核）\n    ↓\n6. 操作系统通过ecall指令调用SBI服务",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    }
  ],
